        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Companies: Emprise Bank\n- Places: Kansas, Wichita, Humboldt, Allen County, Neosho River\n- Concepts: community banks, bank branches, assets\n\nFacts:\n- Emprise Bank is a Kansas-based, family-owned community bank headquartered in Wichita, Kansas.\n- Emprise Bank has more than $1 billion in assets.\n- Emprise Bank has 37 locations across Kansas, including a branch in Humboldt.\n- Emprise Bank also has branches in Wichita, Andover, Augusta, Chanute, Clearwater, Council Grove, Derby, El Dorado, Eureka, Goddard, Hays, Haysville, Hillsboro, Iola, Lawrence, McPherson, Moran, Mulvane, Park City, Potwin, Rose Hill, and Valley Center.\n- Humboldt is a city in Allen County, Kansas, United States.\n- Humboldt is situated along the Neosho River.",
